data: {"id": "def785891cf548b2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1167", "run_id": "def785891cf548b2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 生命周期与状态 (Metrics & K8s)**\n    *   Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 确认容器处于 `Waiting` 状态，等待原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n    *   `kube_pod_status_phase` 为 `Pending`，`restarts=0`，说明 Pod 从未进入运行状态，无重启。\n    *   K8s `kubectl get -o yaml` 确认 Pod 仍为 `Pending`，节点调度到 `node2`，`ContainersReady=False`。\n    *   Topology 确认 Pod 被调度到 `node2`，属于容器 `app`，与 Prometheus 采集的 node 标签一致。\n\n2.  **事件与根因事件 (K8s Events)**\n    *   **关键事件**：kubelet 报 `FailedMount`，明确原文为 `\"MountVolume.SetUp f", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789124957217, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

