data: {"id": "def785891cf548b2-final", "run_id": "def785891cf548b2", "seq": 1172, "ts_ms": 1789124971597, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 的 Volume 'input' 配置引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 Key 'unavailable-key'，导致 kubelet 持续挂载失败 (FailedMount)，容器无法进入 Running 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.phase | phase: Pending | 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s State | pod.condition | ContainersReady: False (ContainersNotReady), Ready: False (ContainersNotReady) | 确认容器不就绪，且 Pod 核心就绪条件未满足 |\n| 3 | K8s State | container.waiting_reason | container: app, reason: ContainerCreating | 明确应用容器卡在挂载/准备阶段 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | event.message | \"MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \\\"input\\\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key\" | 直接证据：指出 Volume 'input' 引用的 Key 'unavailable-key' 在 ConfigMap 中不存在 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | event.message | \"Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition\" | 佐证挂载失败导致的超时现象，与 #4 形成机制闭环 |\n| 6 | Metric | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason | value: 1 (reason: ContainerCreating) | 数值层面确认容器处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- Kubernetes 状态与事件（#1-#4）高度一致：Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态（#1, #3），根本原因为挂载失败（#4），具体失败原因是配置项 Key 缺失（#4），进而导致了超时挂载报错（#5）。\n- Metric 数据（#6）作为补充验证，其 `value: 1` 和 `reason: ContainerCreating` 与 K8s State 中的等待原因（#3）完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 配置错误（引用不存在的 Key 'unavailable-key'） → 挂载失败机制（FailedMount） → 容器状态等待（ContainerCreating） → Pod 状态 Pending / 现象：应用未就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的 Volume `input` 错误引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `unavailable-key`。这一配置错误直接导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败（事实 #4），容器无法启动并长期停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（事实 #3, #6），最终表现为 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态（事实 #1, #2）。证据链完整，因果关系明确。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 40.1s (Evidence 34.5s, RCA 5.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.049, "metrics": {"run_id": "def785891cf548b2", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.05536007881165, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70055.36007881165, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 66344.94352340698, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_to